# The release builder hashes, compares and executes source bytes: check_sdk_sync and
# sync_source_review compare LF source against the embedded blocks, and the staged tree must keep
# shell scripts LF. A Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite PROGRAM/sdk,
# UPDATER and the root launchers to CRLF, and the build dies before packaging.
# Pin every text file to LF so a checkout cannot change what the gate sees.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Batch files are stored with CRLF on purpose (the batch parser needs it), and binary fixtures
# must keep their exact bytes.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.sqlite binary
*.fixture -text
